			}]
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "It's a tough world out there..."
			tasks: [{
				id: "0BBEE112CD8F2883"
				title: "Aggressive weather"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Why is the sun trying to kill me?"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["024BBC15CA0EA6E1"]
			description: ["Early on in your travels, it could be useful to have a waterskin or two in your spacious pockets. This item will help regulate your temperature while in your inventory. It can also be splashed onto you bu right clicking for an instant effect or drank with shift-right click for a more gradual effect."]
			id: "7D9A067417069604"
			rewards: [{
				count: 5
				id: "4605730E7A6DC54B"
				item: "minecraft:cooked_rabbit"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "But I thought there was no thirst bar?"
			tasks: [{
				id: "38C8FBFAA217CA44"
				item: "cold_sweat:waterskin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Water on the go"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D9A067417069604"]
			description: [
				"The waterskin by itself isn't all too useful as it only retains the ambient temperature at which its contents were extracted. Luckily, the &4Boiler&r and &bIcebox&r can fix that! By fueling these machines, they can change the temperature of the waterskins to be either hot or cold."
				"Fueling of these machines is unique: by placing valid fuel items, the machine will gain some percentage in its fuel bar. Valid fuel items for each machine will be present in the next pages."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &4Boiler&r's fuel items and the percentage they fill up are:"
				"-Coal (3.7%)"
				"-Charcoal (3.7%)"
				"-Planks (3.7%)"
				"-Logs (33%)"
				"-Coal Blocks (33%)"
				"-Magma Blocks (33%)"
				"-Lava (100%)"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &bIcebox&r's fuel items and the percentage they fill up are:"
				"-Snowballs (1%)"
				"-Clay Balls (3.7%)"
				"-Snow Blocks (10%)"
				"-Powder Snow (10%)"
				"-Ice (25%)"
				"-Clay Blocks (33%)"
				"-Packed Ice (100%)"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "cold_sweat:filled_waterskin"
				tag: { }
			}
			id: "7B5BF7283276D44B"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 10
