		{
			dependencies: ["7B5BF7283276D44B"]
			description: ["The &4Boiler&r and &bIcebox&r can be further enhanced by installing a &8Smokestack&r on their top. This will allow them to regulate the temperature around them when provided with a redstone signal."]
			id: "47BB72B57CAB7A17"
