			title: "Seeds of the damned"
			x: 0.7d
			y: -1.4d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1DDBA32A6E6DDC98"]
			description: ["While the sprouts are useful, they're not the most convenient, requiring constant consumption to stay cool. There is a tool to fix that problem though: the &9Soulspring Lamp&r, when charged with sprouts, will emit an aura of coldness around it, shielding its wielder from the oppressive heat."]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
